  "bodyHash": "9d0a69586f581ccf",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">双开门（Double Doors）是一款极简风格的模组，它允许相同的成对双开门、陷阱门和栅栏门同时打开。你可以通过点击任意一扇（木质）门，或使用单个压力板或按钮来实现此操作。默认情况下，该模组还会自动寻找其他相连的门类方块并将其一同打开，搜索范围最大为 10 个方块。此功能可在配置文件中开关。村民也能打开双开门！<br><br>蹲下（Shift）将禁用双开门功能，仅打开/关闭单个方块。<br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>如果你希望栅栏门和陷阱门也能“成对”打开，请务必在配置文件中启用相关选项！</strong><br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 RPG 整合包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableRecursiveOpening</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否启用递归开启功能。这允许你例如用陷阱门建造一扇巨大的门，只要它们相连，就能同时打开。'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 配置项决定了该功能搜索的最大距离。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 10，最小值 1，最大值 32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">当启用 'enableRecursiveOpening' 时，递归函数应搜索多少个方块的距离。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableDoors</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，模组将对双开门生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFenceGates</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，模组将对成对的栅栏门生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableTrapdoors</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，模组将对成对的陷阱门生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableModIncompatibilityCheck</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">检查是否加载了其他具有双开门功能的模组。如果发现，会修改其配置文件中的对应行以禁用双开门功能。修复因代码重复运行导致门无法打开的问题。</span><br><br></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>适用于所有双开门配置，同时也支持对其他类型方块进行递归开启！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"332\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>任何相连的门类方块都会被递归查找并打开：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>默认情况下，递归功能会开启距离为 10 个方块的门，但你可以通过 'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 配置项进行修改：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>点击任意一扇门，另一扇也会随之打开：</span></strong><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"848\" height=\"428\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>使用单个按钮即可打开铁门，或任何其他配置组合。</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/e.webp\" alt=\"gif1\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>适用于上下叠放的陷阱门和栅栏门，可通过点击或压力板/按钮控制。</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/f.webp\" alt=\"gif2\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>村民也能打开双开门！</strong></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/h.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组，前提是下载源必须保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在如此多的独立模组页面中追踪评论，因此已关闭评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问我们的 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。感谢支持！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
